title DeepBl4nder Agent Architecture

autonumber

actor User as "User / API Client"
participant DirectorAgent as "Director Agent\n(Orchestrateur principal)"
participant StoryAgent as "Story Agent\n(Scénario / Narratif)"
participant StoryboardAgent as "Storyboard Agent\n(Plan séquence)"
participant CharacterDesignerAgent as "Character Designer\n(Design perso)"
participant EnvironmentArtistAgent as "Environment Artist\n(Design env)"
participant AnimatorAgent as "Animator Agent\n(Animation)"
participant BlenderAgent as "Blender Agent\n(Exécution Blender)"
participant CompositingAgent as "Compositing Agent\n(Post-prod)"
participant AudioAgent as "Audio Agent\n(Sound design)"
participant MusicComposerAgent as "Music Composer\n(Musique)"
participant LocalizationAgent as "Localization Agent\n(Sous-titres / i18n)"
participant QAAgent as "QA Agent\n(Validation qualité)"
participant ReviewAgent as "Review Agent\n(Revue humaine)"
participant UE5Agent as "UE5 Agent\n(Unreal Engine)"
participant Scheduler as "WorkerScheduler\n(Celery + Redis)"
participant BlenderBridge as "BlenderBridge\n(Worker process)"
participant MinIO as "MinIO\n(Object Storage)"
participant Postgres as "PostgreSQL\n(Métadonnées)"
participant Langfuse as "Langfuse\n(Observabilité LLM)"

== Initialisation ==
User->DirectorAgent: POST /api/productions (brief)
DirectorAgent->Postgres: CREATE production + project
DirectorAgent->MinIO: CREATE bucket assets
DirectorAgent->Scheduler: Enqueue story task

== Phase 1: Story & Storyboard ==
DirectorAgent->StoryAgent: generate_story(brief)
StoryAgent->Langfuse: LLM call (Gemini/Groq)
StoryAgent-->>DirectorAgent: StorySpec
DirectorAgent->Postgres: SAVE story

DirectorAgent->StoryboardAgent: generate_storyboard(story)
StoryboardAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
StoryboardAgent-->>DirectorAgent: StoryboardSpec (shots)
DirectorAgent->Postgres: SAVE storyboard

== Phase 2: Assets (parallèle) ==
par Character Design
DirectorAgent->CharacterDesignerAgent: design_characters(story)
CharacterDesignerAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
CharacterDesignerAgent-->>DirectorAgent: CharacterDesignResult
DirectorAgent->MinIO: UPLOAD refs
end

par Environment Design
DirectorAgent->EnvironmentArtistAgent: design_environments(storyboard)
EnvironmentArtistAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
EnvironmentArtistAgent-->>DirectorAgent: EnvironmentDesignResult
DirectorAgent->MinIO: UPLOAD refs
end

== Phase 3: Animation & Blender ==
DirectorAgent->AnimatorAgent: animate_shots(storyboard, characters, env)
AnimatorAgent->Langfuse: LLM call (génère BlenderScript)
AnimatorAgent-->>DirectorAgent: BlenderScript[]
DirectorAgent->Postgres: SAVE scripts

DirectorAgent->Scheduler: Enqueue blender_render tasks
Scheduler->BlenderBridge: RUN blender -b -P script.py
BlenderBridge->BlenderAgent: Exécution headless Blender 4.1
BlenderAgent->MinIO: UPLOAD renders (EXR/PNG/MP4)
BlenderAgent-->>Scheduler: RenderOutput (paths, metadata)
Scheduler-->>DirectorAgent: Render completed

== Phase 4: Audio & Music (parallèle) ==
par Sound Design
DirectorAgent->AudioAgent: create_audio_plan(renders)
AudioAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
AudioAgent-->>DirectorAgent: AudioPlan
DirectorAgent->Scheduler: Enqueue tts/sfx tasks
end

par Music Composition
DirectorAgent->MusicComposerAgent: compose_music(story, mood)
MusicComposerAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
MusicComposerAgent-->>DirectorAgent: MusicPlan
DirectorAgent->Scheduler: Enqueue music generation
end

== Phase 5: Compositing & Localization ==
DirectorAgent->CompositingAgent: composite(renders, audio, music)
CompositingAgent->Scheduler: Enqueue ffmpeg/blender compositing
CompositingAgent-->>DirectorAgent: CompositeSpec

DirectorAgent->LocalizationAgent: localize(dialogs, target_langs)
LocalizationAgent->Langfuse: LLM call
LocalizationAgent-->>DirectorAgent: LanguagePackage[]

== Phase 6: QA & Review ==
DirectorAgent->QAAgent: validate_all(outputs)
QAAgent->Langfuse: LLM call (visual QA si dispo)
QAAgent-->>DirectorAgent: QAReport (issues, score)

alt QA passed
DirectorAgent->ReviewAgent: request_human_review(production)
ReviewAgent-->>User: Notification review required
User->ReviewAgent: APPROVE / REQUEST_CHANGES
else QA failed
DirectorAgent->DirectorAgent: Retry failed steps (max 3)
end

== Livraison ==
DirectorAgent->MinIO: Package final assets
DirectorAgent->Postgres: UPDATE production status=DELIVERED
DirectorAgent-->>User: Production ready (URLs MinIO)

== Observabilité ==
note right of Langfuse: Tous les appels LLM tracés\n(traces, spans, coûts, tokens)
note right of Scheduler: Celery + Redis\n(retries, timeouts, priority)
note right of MinIO: Versioning assets\n(previews, finals, checkpoints)
note right of Postgres: Productions, Projects,\nScenes, Shots, Assets, Runs